    ["<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Congratulations! You've found the correct throne~"] = "<P_Yellow>Клоун</>: Поздравляем! Вы нашли правильный трон~",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n在命运时刻战场中，非凡者分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Highlight>4分钟</>，对局结束时分数较高的一方获胜，积分相同则依次判断击杀数和伤害量，高的一方获胜，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>机制说明</>\n<Highlight>积分获取：</>可通过拾取增益光点、击杀、助攻、进入纷争漩涡争夺来获取。\n<Highlight>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Highlight>15秒</>，届时根据锚点<Highlight>需求人数</>进入锚点，人数达到要求后持续<Highlight>3秒</>后将会将本阵营非凡者集结于此，同时参与集结的非凡者将获得限时属性加成。\n<Highlight>纷争漩涡：</>战场中间会出现纷争漩涡，纷争漩涡<Highlight>倒计时结束时</>留在漩涡内的非凡者将平分积分。\n<Highlight>增益光点：</>战场中会出现增益光点，拾取增益光点会获得<Highlight>积分及属性加成</>。\n<Highlight>命运蘑菇：</>非凡者在命运时刻战场中，连续阵亡三次后会掉落命运蘑菇：友方阵亡将掉落拥有丰饶力量的绿色命运蘑菇，拾取后恢复生命值，敌方阵亡将掉落拥有毁灭力量的红色命运蘑菇，拾取后将扣除生命值，请注意分辨后拾取。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up.",
